Shortest Path (https://github.com/Skretzo/shortest-path), BSD 2-Clause
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The bank, altar and anvil tables, the transport tables for boats, charter ships, canoes, carpets,
minecarts, levers, portals, gliders, balloons, mushtrees, quetzals, spirit trees, obelisks and fairy
rings that drive the transport hover cards, the teleport tables (spells, jewellery and other items,
minigame teleports, house jewellery boxes, the quetzal whistle and home teleports) that drive the
teleport cards, the table of which region of the world each map square belongs to that drives the
region borders. The agility shortcut
table (levels, items and where each shortcut comes out) and the few trip rows of the general transport table
(travel carts, guides, rafts) are also from Shortest Path.

